{"created": "2026-10-05T05:49:54.595011+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-10T21:42:55.280580+00:00", "id": 23153134, "conceptrecid": "23153133", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23153134", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23153133", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23153134", "metadata": {"title": "A complete negatively curved observation Gramian with two-state ambiguity", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23153134", "publication_date": "2026-10-05", "description": "<p>We give a nonvacuous two-dimensional counterexample to the manifold conjecture printed by Krener in OWR11/2009. A smooth observed system on a connected closed genus-three surface has zero dynamics and output in R17 obtained by composing a connected two-sheeted hyperbolic covering with a smooth Nash isometric embedding. Its exact finite-time differential observation Gramian is P_T=T*pi^*g. For every fixed positive T it is geodesically complete with actual sectional curvature -1/T and uniform positive upper and lower bounds relative to any fixed smooth background metric and a fixed finite normalized atlas. The history map is locally injective but every attained history has exactly two initial states.</p><p>The construction is an application of classical constructions, with Nash, covering classification, hyperbolic geometry and older local/global observability ambiguity explicitly credited. A bounded primary-source audit, including complete readings of Dirr2009 and Kang2013 and a fresh independent adversarial priority assessment, found no verified earlier explicit complete construction in inspected sources. Those two named access gaps are closed; older uninspected originals and corpus limits are documented. No absolute firstness, continuous seventeen-year openness, new covering/Nash mechanism, or first refutation of every literal dimensional reading is claimed. A strengthened question restricted to one global Euclidean state domain is outside this result.</p><p>AI tools were used extensively in solving, drafting, reproducing and adversarially reviewing the work. This is an unrefereed preprint without conventional human peer review. The package provides the analytical proof and a dependency-free supplementary exact verifier with recorded results, source and priority supplement, reproducibility instructions, license and file digests. Finite controls do not construct a Nash embedding or machine-certify global topology or completeness.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kriebel, Alec", "affiliation": "Independent researcher", "orcid": "0009-0001-9320-500X"}], "keywords": ["global observability", "observation Gramian", "negative curvature", "hyperbolic surfaces", "finite covering spaces", "Nash isometric embedding", "nonlinear control", "local observability", "differential observation metric", "state indistinguishability", "double covers", "genus-three surface", "Riemannian geometry", "Krener curvature conjecture"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.4171/OWR/2009/11", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1109/TAC.1977.1101601", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.23919/ECC.2009.7075123", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1007/978-3-642-35088-7_1", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1090/S0002-9904-1974-13502-0", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23153133"}}]}}, "title": "A complete negatively curved observation Gramian with two-state ambiguity", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23153134", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23153134?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23153134", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23153134", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23153134", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153133", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23153133", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23153133", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23153133", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134:negative_gramian_cover.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134:negative_gramian_cover.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134:negative_gramian_cover.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134:negative_gramian_cover.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134:negative_gramian_cover.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23153134:negative_gramian_cover.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23153134/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-10T21:42:55.280580+00:00", "recid": "23153134", "revision": 5, "files": [{"id": "586fc480-e3ae-485c-82a6-436c1399e9ba", "key": "negative_gramian_cover.tex", "size": 15912, "checksum": "md5:5d7efda5d8d9686a7cfec8d8b0e01566", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/files/negative_gramian_cover.tex/content"}}, {"id": "b1532f03-59c1-4b86-a4f9-92dd9a247704", "key": "verification_results.json", "size": 2832, "checksum": "md5:1adff8b4802114b103792e0f97a99ae6", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/files/verification_results.json/content"}}, {"id": "fd483f7f-757d-4cc0-952f-1784084c8cbd", "key": "SOURCE_AUDIT.md", "size": 21292, "checksum": "md5:e78ae48821fa2c884dc930c2613cc4b7", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/files/SOURCE_AUDIT.md/content"}}, {"id": "ba21073c-8bfd-4aa0-93a7-02361dfff28e", "key": "SHA256SUMS.txt", "size": 697, "checksum": "md5:0241740c5e5d4b3fc504951dffb0bc66", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/files/SHA256SUMS.txt/content"}}, {"id": "fda550f4-30da-4f5b-bbae-5672764fa5e4", "key": "LICENSE.txt", "size": 682, "checksum": "md5:3f8a76abf91ba68b7eff14ffc170ef85", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/files/LICENSE.txt/content"}}, {"id": "1530c5d4-0438-4de5-a9c8-56a89e38397c", "key": "negative_gramian_cover_sources.zip", "size": 25192, "checksum": "md5:179c073251a46256f2b8ecfe2d2201d8", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23153134/files/negative_gramian_cover_sources.zip/content"}}, {"id": "5b8